# Portfolio project overview

This is a **personal portfolio** (product designer / UX researcher) built with
**Jekyll** + **GitHub Pages**, remote theme `pages-themes/minimal`. It is shared
on job boards and with hiring managers, so **content clarity** and **page speed**
are the top priorities.

- Each `*.md` at the repo root is one case study, built to `<name>.html`.
- `index.md` is the landing page with featured case cards.
- Layouts: `_layouts/default.html`; `_layouts/mermaid.html` adds diagram rendering.
- `_includes/head-custom.html` holds performance `<head>` additions.
- Styles/tokens (incl. light/dark theme): `assets/css/style.scss`.

Run locally: `bundle exec jekyll serve --livereload` (http://127.0.0.1:4000/).
Full guidance is in `AGENTS.md`.

When editing a case, follow `writing-cases.mdc`. When touching images, diagrams,
layouts, or CSS, follow `performance.mdc`. Never invent metrics or facts about the
work; keep the author's voice and fix only real errors unless asked to rewrite.
